NAME: SPL starts a second process
DESCRIPTION: (SPL (Dir 2)) leaves one process on JMP #0 and starts an imp two cells on; see behtests/spl_two_processes.beh
SRC:
(seq
  (SPL (Dir 2))
  (JMP 0)
  (MOV (Dir 0) (Dir 1)))
EXPECTED:
;redcode-94b

  SPL    $2     , #0     
  JMP    #0     , #0     
  MOV.I  $0     , $1     
  DAT    $0     , $0     